+# Post-617 Deferred Code Gaps (Claude Code Scope)
+
+The following items were identified during the post-617 audit but overlap with Claude Code's ongoing work on Authority Review Mode and Proposal Quality Engine. These should be addressed by Claude Code or in a future session.
+
+## 1. Authority Review Mode
+- Implementation of the reviewer-facing UI and approval workflow.
+- Integration of authority-level blockers into the export gate.
+
+## 2. Final Package Quality Score
+- Calculation of an aggregate quality score for the entire submission package.
+- UI display of the quality score in the Export/Manifest panel.
+
+## 3. Section-level Generated Proposal Scoring
+- Detailed scoring and critique for individual generated sections.
+- Resumable generation based on section scores.
+
+## 4. Source-grounded Final Proposal Validation
+- Deep validation of the final proposal prose against extracted source requirements.
+- Detection of hallucinations or missing mandatory evidence in the final output.
+
+## 5. Export Blocker Integration
+- Wiring up "Authority Review" and "Quality Score" blockers into `checkFullExportReadiness`.
+
+## 6. Document Validation Panel UI
+- Enhancements to `components/document-validator-panel.tsx` for Authority Review Mode.
